From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 09:37:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(kanban): expose durable CI and deploy wait episode age
 [daveey]

Derive the current continuous producer wait from bounded persisted lifecycle history, preserving same-producer re-parks and reporting unknown starts truthfully. Expose it on scheduled card details for the Desktop row. Proof: canonical wait episode and wait info suites; rendering coverage lives in session-panel.
---
